---
import SEOHead from '../../components/SEOHead.astro';

const title = "GridPaw Privacy Policy — How We Handle Your Data";
const description = "GridPaw privacy policy. Play anonymously — all game progress stays in your browser. Optional Google sign-in only stores your name, email, and profile picture to sync your streak.";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <SEOHead title={title} description={description} canonical="/privacy" type="article" />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "GridPaw Privacy Policy",
    "description": description,
    "url": "https://gridpaw.com/privacy",
    "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "GridPaw" },
    "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "GridPaw" }
  })} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://gridpaw.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Privacy Policy", "item": "https://gridpaw.com/privacy" }
    ]
  })} />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="GridPaw home">
        <span class="brand-logo"><img src="/assets/logo-clay-cat.png" alt="GridPaw cat mascot" width="40" height="40" /></span>
        <span class="brand-name">
          <span class="big">GridPaw</span>
          <span class="small">Akari Puzzle Game</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/">Play</a>
        <a href="/how-to-play/">How to Play</a>
        <a href="/tips/">Tips</a>
        <a href="/daily/">Daily</a>
        <a href="/solver/">Solver</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a> &gt; <span>Privacy Policy</span>
  </nav>

  <main class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy <span class="accent">Policy</span></h1>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>GridPaw is a free Akari (Light Up) puzzle game. We are committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains what data we handle and how.</p>

    <h2>Data We Do NOT Collect</h2>
    <p>GridPaw does <strong>not</strong> collect, store, transmit, or share any of the following:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Financial or payment information</li>
      <li>Location data</li>
      <li>Browsing history</li>
      <li>Health information</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Local Storage (No Account Needed)</h2>
    <p>By default, all game data is stored <strong>locally in your browser</strong> using <code>localStorage</code>. This includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your current puzzle progress and level</li>
      <li>Daily challenge streak and best times</li>
      <li>Game settings (sound preferences)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This data never leaves your device unless you choose to sign in. Clearing your browser data will erase this information.</p>

    <h2>Optional Google Sign-In</h2>
    <p>Signing in with Google is <strong>entirely optional</strong>. The game is fully playable without an account. If you choose to sign in, we collect and store only what Google shares after you approve:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your Google account name and profile picture (shown on the leaderboard)</li>
      <li>Your Google account email (used only to identify your account; never shown publicly)</li>
      <li>Your Google account ID (a random number Google uses to identify you to websites)</li>
      <li>Your daily challenge progress: streak, best streak, best time, and completion dates</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We use this data for exactly one purpose: <strong>syncing your puzzle progress across devices and showing the daily leaderboard</strong>. We do not:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Send you marketing emails or newsletters</li>
      <li>Sell or share your data with advertisers or data brokers</li>
      <li>Post anything to your Google account</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Sign-in uses a secure first-party session cookie (<code>mt_session</code>) that contains no personal information — just a random ID. You can sign out at any time, which clears this cookie. To delete your account and all stored progress, contact us using the link below.</p>

    <h2>Chrome Extension</h2>
    <p>The GridPaw Chrome extension uses <code>chrome.storage.local</code> to store streak and puzzle stats locally. The extension:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Does <strong>not</strong> collect any personal data</li>
      <li>Does <strong>not</strong> transmit data to external servers</li>
      <li>Does <strong>not</strong> use remotely hosted code</li>
      <li>Does <strong>not</strong> track your browsing activity</li>
      <li>Only accesses data on <code>gridpaw.com</code> to sync your puzzle progress</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>GridPaw is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may collect standard server logs (IP address, browser type) as part of their normal hosting operations. For details, see <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>GridPaw does not knowingly collect any data from children under 13. The game is fully playable without any account, and sign-in is optional and intended for users 13 and older. The game is suitable for all ages.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, or want to delete your account and stored progress, you can reach us at:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Website: <a href="https://gridpaw.com">gridpaw.com</a></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <a href="/" class="cta-btn">🐱 Play GridPaw Free</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/">Play</a>
        <a href="/rules/">Rules</a>
        <a href="/tips/">Tips</a>
        <a href="/daily/">Daily</a>
        <a href="/solver/">Solver</a>
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-siblings">
        <span>Our other sites:</span>
        <a href="https://furriq.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Furriq</a>
        <a href="https://gridpaw.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GridPaw</a>
        <a href="https://pictomino.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pictomino</a>
      </div>
      <p class="footer-copy">&copy; 2026 GridPaw. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <style is:global>
    .prose { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
    .prose h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 900; color: #342421; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .prose h1 .accent { color: #559c68; }
    .prose h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #342421; margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #f4dfdc; }
    .prose p { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #6f5651; }
    .prose ul, .prose ol { margin: 0 0 1rem 1.5rem; }
    .prose li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #6f5651; }
    .prose strong { color: #342421; }
    .prose code { background: #f4dfdc; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .prose a { color: #E8A888; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600; }
    .prose a:hover { color: #D47A50; }
    .cta-box { text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0 1rem; }
    .cta-btn { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E8A888, #D47A50); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem; border-radius: 1rem; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(232,168,136,0.3); }
    .cta-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(232,168,136,0.4); }
    .site-header { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border-bottom: 1px solid #f4dfdc; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
    .header-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .brand-logo img { border-radius: 0.5rem; }
    .brand-name .big { display: block; font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #342421; line-height: 1.1; }
    .brand-name .small { display: block; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #9b726c; font-weight: 600; }
    .nav { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; }
    .nav a { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; color: #6f5651; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.15s; }
    .nav a:hover { color: #342421; }
    nav[aria-label="Breadcrumb"] { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem 1.5rem 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #9b726c; }
    nav[aria-label="Breadcrumb"] a { color: #9b726c; text-decoration: none; }
    nav[aria-label="Breadcrumb"] a:hover { color: #342421; }
    .site-footer { background: #342421; color: #d4c8c0; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .footer-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .footer-links a { color: #d4c8c0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #E8A888; }
    .footer-siblings { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #9b8a82; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .footer-siblings a { color: #b8a8a0; margin-left: 0.5rem; }
    .footer-siblings a:hover { color: #E8A888; }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #7a6a62; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .header-inner { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
      .nav { gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
      .prose h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>
